---
description: >-
  The markdownAlwaysOn twin of label-syntax.mmd: with the setting on every
  label is markdown, so the plain **bold** _ital_ names draw bold and italic,
  the code span and bare backticks draw inline code, and __init__.py draws a
  bold init; tags and a written \n read as in the default mode, so the picture
  differs from label-syntax.mmd (#1368).
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
---
treeView-beta
  plain/
    unquoted **bold** _ital_
    "quoted **bold** _ital_"
  "`md dir **bold** _ital_`/"
    "`quoted md **bold** _ital_`"
    '`single md **bold** _ital_`'
  backticks/
    `bare **bold** _ital_`
    code a `code` b
  "tags <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i>/"
    unquoted tag<br>next
    "quoted <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  breaks/
    unquoted one\ntwo
    "quoted one\ntwo"
    "`md **one**\ntwo`"
  names/
    my_file_name.spec.ts
    __init__.py
